    },
    "transportBoundary": "New header-preserving bounded federation transport does not relax ordinary2MiB or media limits; URLSession cookie/cache/credential stores remain disabled and redirects rejected. URLProtocol and injectable-browser tests are explicit doubles, authored only.",
